{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_0","type":"agent_message","text":"I’ll build a cel-shaded arcade rescue game around Cosmic Ark’s alternating meteor defense and creature collection, with controller-first menus, co-op, and a playable attract mode. I’ll use native knowledge for the source and read the required AI Hub integration files directly.\n"}}
