 h2{font-size:16px}.mission p{font-size:11px}.stat .label{font-size:8px}.howgrid,.aboutgrid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.setting{grid-template-columns:1fr 130px}.panel{max-height:92vh}.topbar{gap:8px}#hud{padding:15px}#announce{max-width:90vw;white-space:normal;font-size:13px}.bottomLeft{left:15px;bottom:20px;max-width:240px}.bottomRight{right:15px;bottom:20px;min-width:130px}.phaseHelp{padding:10px}.phaseHelp p{font-size:11px}.controlsLine{font-size:10px}.cargo{font-size:11px}}\n</style></head><body><canvas id=\"game\" aria-label=\"The Great Space Escape game world\"></canvas><div id=\"vignette\"></div><div id=\"ui\">\n<div id=\"loading\"><div class=\"loader\"></div><h2>Preparing the lifeboat.</h2><p id=\"loadingText\">WebGPU · hand-built worlds · twelve very odd passengers</p></div>\n<section id=\"title\" hidden><div class=\"brandline\"><span class=\"mark\">✳</span> NOVA CONSERVATION CORPS <span style=\"color:#7d969d\">/ FLIGHT 082</span></div><h1>THE GREAT<br>SPACE<span>ESCAPE.</span></h1><p class=\"tagline\">Small ship. Strange cargo. Last chance.</p><div class=\"titleActions\"><button class=\"primary\" data-action=\"start\">Launch rescue <span>↗</span></button><button class=\"small\" data-action=\"coop\">Two-pilot co-op</button><button class=\"small\" data-action=\"how\">Flight manual</button><button class=\"small\" data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button><button class=\"small\" data-action=\"about\">About / credits</button></div><div class=\"titleFoot\">INSPIRED BY COSMIC ARK, 1982 &nbsp; · &nbsp; A SMALL ACT OF COSMIC KINDNESS</div><div class=\"sceneTag\"><div class=\"rule\"></div><span class=\"label\">Destination 01 / 03</span><b>THE MOSS MOON</b><p>They have no idea the sun is going out.</p><p>Fortunately, you brought a tractor beam.</p></div></section>\n<section id=\"hud\" hidden><div class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"mission\"><span class=\"label\" id=\"worldLabel\"></span><h2 id=\"phaseTitle\"></h2><p id=\"missionLine\"></p></div><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"label\">Ark hull</span><strong class=\"hulls\" id=\"hullValue\"></strong></div><div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"label\" id=\"timerLabel\">Next jump</span><strong id=\"timerValue\"></strong></div><div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"label\">Score</span><strong id=\"scoreValue\"></strong></div></div><button class=\"pauseBtn\" data-action=\"pause\" aria-label=\"Pause\">Ⅱ</button></div><div class=\"bottomLeft\"><div class=\"phaseHelp\"><h3 id=\"helpTitle\"></h3><p id=\"helpText\"></p></div><div class=\"controlsLine\" id=\"controlsLine\"></div></div><div class=\"bottomRight\"><span class=\"label\" id=\"chargeLabel\">Shield pulse · 100%</span><div class=\"chargeTrack\"><div class=\"chargeFill\" id=\"chargeFill\"></div></div><div class=\"cargo\" id=\"cargoValue\"></div></div></section>\n<div id=\"announce\" hidden></div><div id=\"warp\" hidden><span class=\"label\">EVERY LITTLE LIFE COUNTS</span><h2 id=\"warpTitle\"></h2><p id=\"warpText\"></p></div><div id=\"attract\" hidden><b>AUTOPILOT / DEMONSTRATION</b><p>Press any button to take command</p></div><div id=\"menu\" hidden></div><div id=\"touchHint\" hidden>Drag left to fly · hold right to rescue · double-tap to boost</div><div id=\"touchRing\"></div></div>\n<script type=\"module\">/*GAME_BUNDLE*/</script></body></html>\nEOF'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_9","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > index.template.html <<'EOF'\n<\"'!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<!--HUB_CLIENT-->\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#081a25\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\"><meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\"><meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"shared-world\"><meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Save twelve strange creatures across three worlds, then survive the final meteor storm. Shared hull, shared victory.\"><meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Left stick / WASD: aim or fly. R2 / Space: shoot or tractor beam. Cross / Shift: shield pulse or boost. Options / Esc: pause.\"><meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"5\"><meta name=\"hub:webgpu\" content=\"required\">\n<title>The Great Space Escape</title>\n<style>\n:root{--ink:#081a25;--paper:#f5efd9;--mint:#9cf0cd;--orange:#ffa56d;--dim:#9cafaf;--panel:rgba(8,26,37,.94);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:var(--paper);background:var(--ink);font-synthesis:none;color-scheme:dark}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;overflow:hidden}button,input{font:inherit}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--orange);outline-offset:5px}button{color:var(--paper);border:1px solid #48626b;background:#18333e;border-radius:5px;padding:15px 22px;font-weight:750;font-size:19px;text-align:left;transition:background .12s,transform .12s}button:hover,button:focus{background:#2a4b54}button.primary{background:var(--mint);border-color:var(--mint);color:var(--ink)}button.primary:hover,button.primary:focus{background:#c6ffe6}button.small{font-size:15px;padding:10px 15px}.label{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2.5px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--mint)}canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width: