{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"The core campaign now passes a scripted playthrough from the first meteor wave through all twelve rescues and the final storm. Testing caught and fixed a Rapier API mismatch; the scene also compiles on the actual WebGPU backend. I’m now checking the menus, controller and touch inputs, and AI Hub sessions in the assembled game.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat network.js'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc 'cat network.js'","aggregated_output":"/* AI Hub shared-world adapter. Standalone co-op is handled by the same simulation locally. */\nexport async function createNetwork(callbacks = {}) {\n  const hub = globalThis.AIHub;\n  const listeners = [];\n  let readyCalled = false;\n  let startReceived = false;\n  let started = false;\n  let ended = false;\n  let reported = false;\n  let pendingInput = {};\n  let pendingState = null;\n  let inputClock = 0;\n  let stateClock = 0;\n  let inputSeq = 0;\n  let stateSeq = 0;\n  let lastStateSeq = -1;\n  let lastStateAt = 0;\n  const inputSequences = new Map();\n  const counts = { sentInputs: 0, receivedInputs: 0, sentStates: 0, receivedStates: 0, dropped: 0, oversize: 0, maxBytes: 0 };\n  const info = hub ? await hub.connect({ mode: 'shared-world', seats: [1, 4] }) : null;\n  const net = {\n    active: !!info,\n    info,\n    isHost: info ? !!info.isHost : true,\n    me: info ? info.me : 0,\n    players: info ? info.players.slice() : [{ id: 0, name: 'Pilot 1', color: '#f3b05c' }],\n    ready() {\n      if (!net.active || readyCalled || ended) return;\n      readyCalled = true;\n      hub.ready();\n    },\n    sendInput(input) {\n      if (!net.active || net.isHost || ended || reported) return;\n      pendingInput = plainCopy(input, 2048) || {};\n    },\n    broadcast(state) {\n      if (!net.active || !net.isHost || ended || reported) return;\n      pendingState = state;\n    },\n    finish(score = 0, won = false) {\n      if (!net.active || !net.isHost || ended || reported) return;\n      reported = true;\n      const value = Number.isFinite(Number(score)) ? Number(score) : 0;\n      const ids = net.players.map(p => p.id);\n      const scores = Object.fromEntries(ids.map(id => [id, value]));\n      hub.finish({ standings: [ids], scores, won: !!won });\n    },\n    tick(dt = 0) {\n      if (!net.active || ended || reported) return;\n      if (!started && startReceived && hub.time() >= 0) {\n        started = true;\n        inputClock = 1;\n        stateClock = 1;\n        callbacks.onStart?.(info);\n      }\n      if (!started || ended || reported) return;\n      const elapsed = Math.max(0, Math.min(Number.isFinite(dt) ? dt : 0, 1));\n      inputClock += elapsed;\n      stateClock += elapsed;\n      if (!net.isHost && inputClock >= 1 / 15) {\n        inputClock %= 1 / 15;\n        if (hub.send({ kind: 'input', sequence: inputSeq++, input: pendingInput }, { to: info.host, reliable: false })) counts.sentInputs++;\n        else counts.dropped++;\n      }\n      if (net.isHost && pendingState && stateClock >= 1 / 10) {\n        stateClock %= 1 / 10;\n        const packet = { kind: 'world', sequence: stateSeq++, state: pendingState };\n        let text;\n        try { text = JSON.stringify(packet); } catch { text = null; }\n        // Leave room below the protocol limit, even when Unicode uses multiple bytes.\n        const bytes = text ? new TextEncoder().encode(text).byteLength : Infinity;\n        counts.maxBytes = Math.max(counts.maxBytes, Number.isFinite(bytes) ? bytes : 0);\n        if (bytes <= 16000) {\n          if (hub.send(packet, { reliable: true })) counts.sentStates++;\n          else counts.dropped++;\n        } else counts.oversize++;\n      }\n    },\n    diagnostics() {\n      return { ...counts, active: net.active, host: net.isHost, me: net.me, server: !!info?.server,\n        ready: readyCalled, started, ended, reported, players: net.players.map(p => p.id),\n        lastStateAge: lastStateAt ? Math.max(0, performance.now() - lastStateAt) : null };\n    },\n    dispose() {\n      ended = true;\n      for (const off of listeners) off();\n      listeners.length = 0;\n      pendingState = null;\n      pendingInput = {};\n    }\n  };\n  if (!info) return net;\n  listeners.push(hub.on('start', () => { startReceived = true; }));\n  listeners.push(hub.on('message', (packet, from) => {\n    if (ended || reported || !packet || typeof packet !== 'object') return;\n    if (packet.kind === 'input' && net.isHost && net.players.some(p => p.id === from)) {\n      if (!Number.isInteger(packet.sequence) || packet.sequence <= (inputSequences.get(from) ?? -1)) return;\n      const input = plainCopy(packet.input, 2048);\n      if (!input) return;\n      inputSequences.set(from, packet.sequence);\n      counts.receivedInputs++;\n      callbacks.onInput?.(from, input);\n    } else if (packet.kind === 'world' && !net.isHost && from === info.host) {\n      if (!Number.isInteger(packet.sequence) || packet.sequence <= lastStateSeq || !packet.state || typeof packet.state !== 'object') return;\n      lastStateSeq = packet.sequence;\n      lastStateAt = performance.now();\n      counts.receivedStates++;\n      callbacks.onState?.(packet.state);\n    }\n  }));\n  listeners.push(hub.on('leave', data => {\n    net.players = net.players.filter(p => p.id !== data.id);\n    inputSequences.delete(data.id);\n    callbacks.onLeave?.(data);\n  }));\n  listeners.push(hub.on('time-up', data => {\n    if (ended || reported) return;\n    if (callbacks.onTimeUp) callbacks.onTimeUp(data);\n    else if (net.isHost) net.finish(0, false);\n  }));\n  listeners.push(hub.on('end', data => {\n    if (ended) return;\n    ended = true;\n    pendingState = null;\n    pendingInput = {};\n    callbacks.onEnd?.(data);\n  }));\n  return net;\n}\n\nfunction plainCopy(value, limit) {\n  if (!value || typeof value !== 'object' || Array.isArray(value)) return null;\n  try {\n    const text = JSON.stringify(value);\n    if (text.length > limit) return null;\n    return JSON.parse(text);\n  } catch { return null; }\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > app.js <<'EOF'\nimport {createScene} from './scene.js';\nimport {createAudio,renderAudioTest} from './audio.js';\nimport {Game,DEFAULTS,initPhysics} from './game.js';\nimport {createNetwork} from './network.js';\nimport interview from './credits.json';\nconst \"'$=id=>document.getElementById(id), clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));\nconst worlds=['\"'THE MOSS MOON','THE AMBER WILDS','THE VIOLET TIDE'];\nconst audio=createAudio();let game,scene,net,menu='',returnMenu='',lastTime=performance.now(),idle=0,inputMode='keyboard',glyphs='ps',localCount=1,hubStarted=false,hubEnded=false,reducedMotion=false,endShown=false,frameCount=0,loading=true,lastPadButtons=[],lastNav=0;\nconst keys=new Set(),remoteInputs={},mouse={x:0,y:1,down:false,moved:false,target:null},touches=new Map();let touchEnabled=false,touchPulse=false,lastTouch=0,stick=null;\nconst settings={music:.1,sfx:.65,glyphs:'ps',reducedMotion:false};\ntry{Object.assign(settings,JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('great-space-escape.settings')||'{}'));}catch{}\naudio.setMusic(settings.music);audio.setSfx(settings.sfx);glyphs=settings.glyphs;reducedMotion=settings.reducedMotion;\nfunction saveSettings(){try{localStorage.setItem('great-space-escape.settings',JSON.stringify(settings));}catch{}}\nfunction esc(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>\\\"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\\\"':'&quot;',\\\"'\\\":'&#39;'}[c]));}\nfunction show(id,value){\"'$(id).hidden=!value;}\nfunction focusFirst(){requestAnimationFrame(()=>{const area=!$('\"'menu').hidden?\"'$('\"'menu'):\"'$('\"'title');area.querySelector('button')?.focus({preventScroll:true});});}\nfunction activeInput(mode='keyboard'){inputMode=mode;idle=0;audio.unlock();if(game?.state.attract){toTitle();return true;}return hubEnded;}\nfunction setMenu(name,back=''){if(loading||hubEnded)return;menu=name;if(back)returnMenu=back;renderMenu();audio.event('menu');focusFirst();}\nfunction closeMenu(){menu='';\"'$('\"'menu').hidden=true;idle=0;}\nfunction toTitle(){if(net?.active)return;closeMenu();game.reset('title',1);game.state.attract=false;endShown=false;idle=0;audio.setMuted(false);show('title',true);show('hud',false);show('attract',false);focusFirst();}\nfunction launch(count=1){if(net?.active)return;localCount=count;game.start(count);endShown=false;closeMenu();show('title',false);show('hud',true);audio.unlock();}\nfunction pause(){if(\"'!game||loading||hubEnded||game.state.phase==='\"'title')return;if(menu==='pause')closeMenu();else if(menu)closeMenu();else setMenu('pause');}\nfunction button(action,label,cls=''){return \"'`<button class=\"${cls}\" data-action=\"${action}\">${label}</button>`;}\nfunction panel(label,title,content,wide=false){return `<div class=\"panel ${wide?'\"'wide':''}\\\"><span class=\\\"label\\\">\"'${label}</span><h2>${title}</h2>${content}</div>`;}\nfunction aboutHtml(){const labels={date:'\"'Date',source:'Source',plan:'Plan',genre:'Genre',perspective:'Perspective',tech:'Tech',artDirection:'Art direction',animation:'Animation',audio:'Audio',online:'Online',testing:'Testing',research:'Research',environment:'Environment',model:'Model',usage:'Usage'};let html='<p>A small act of cosmic kindness. Built as an original tribute to the rescue-and-defend rhythm of Cosmic Ark.</p><div class=\\\"aboutgrid\\\">';for(const [key,label]of Object.entries(labels))html+=\"'`<div class=\"aboutitem\"><b>${label}</b><p>${esc(interview.sourceInformation[key])}</p></div>`;html+='\"'</div>';const groups=[['Testing Feedback',interview.testingFeedback],['Engine Feedback',interview.engineFeedback],['Prompt Feedback',interview.promptFeedback]];for(const [title,items]of groups){html+=\"'`<div class=\"feedback\"><h3>${title}</h3>`+items.map((text,i)=>`<p><b>${i+1}.</b> ${esc(text)}</p>`).join('\"'')+'</div>';}return html+button('back','← Back','back');}\nfunction renderMenu(){show('menu',\"'!!menu);if(!menu)return;let html='\"'';if(menu==='pause'){html=panel('FLIGHT ON HOLD',net?.active?'Crew console':'Take a breath.',\"'`<p>${net?.active?'\"'The shared mission continues while this console is open.':'Your passengers appreciate a pilot who takes breaks.'}</p><div class=\\\"menuButtons\\\">\"'${button('\"'resume','Resume flight','primary')}\"'${button('\"'how','Flight manual')}\"'${button('\"'settings','Settings')}\"'${button('\"'dev','Developer tools')}\"'${button('\"'about','About / credits')}\"'${!net?.active?button('\"'title','Return to title'):''}</div>\"'`);}\n if(menu==='\"'settings'){html=panel('PILOT PREFERENCES','Make yourself at home.',\"'`<div class=\"setting\"><label for=\"music\">Music <output id=\"musicOut\">${Math.round(settings.music*100)}%</output></label><input id=\"music\" data-setting=\"music\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\".01\" value=\"${settings.music}\" aria-label=\"Music volume\"></div><div class=\"setting\"><label for=\"sfx\">Effects & voices <output id=\"sfxOut\">${Math.round(settings.sfx*100)}%</output></label><input id=\"sfx\" data-setting=\"sfx\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\".01\" value=\"${settings.sfx}\" aria-label=\"Effects volume\"></div><div class=\"setting\"><span>Controller glyphs</span>${button('\"'glyphs',glyphs==='ps'?'PlayStation':'Xbox')}</div><div class=\\\"setting\\\"><span>Gentle motion</span>\"'${button('\"'motion',reducedMotion?'On':'Off')}</div><p class=\\\"tip\\\">Music starts at 10%. Settings stay on this device.</p>\"'${button('\"'back','← Back','back')}\"'`);}\n if(menu==='\"'how'){html=panel('THE FLIGHT MANUAL','Leave no weirdling behind.',\"'`<div class=\"howgrid\"><div><h3>01 / Stand your ground</h3><p>Aim in four directions. Hold fire to break incoming meteors before they reach the ark. A shield pulse clears nearby danger and costs 38% energy.</p><h3>02 / Get down there</h3><p>Fly below the dotted beam-range line. Hold the tractor beam over a creature until it pops aboard. You can carry two at once.</p></div><div><h3>03 / Bring them home</h3><p>Fly to the glowing dock beneath the ark to unload automatically. Save both pairs before the next solar flare. Dodge the pink sentries or boost through them.</p><h3>04 / One last storm</h3><p>Three worlds. Twelve passengers. Survive the final 30-second barrage to escape. The crew shares six hull points; each world repairs one.</p></div></div><p><b>Pad:</b> Left stick: aim / fly · R2: fire / beam · ${glyphs==='\"'ps'?'Cross':'A'}: pulse / boost · Options: pause.<br><b>Keyboard:</b> WASD: aim / fly · Mouse: aim · Space / left click: fire / beam · Shift: pulse / boost · Esc: pause.<br><b>Second local pilot:</b> second pad, or arrow keys + Enter + Right Ctrl.<br><b>Touch:</b> invisible left stick, automatic fire / beam, double-tap right to boost. Drag on the right to aim.</p><p class=\\\"tip\\\">Co-op: each pilot has a shuttle and a two-creature hold. Energy and hull are shared. In AI Hub, 1–4 pilots share one mission.</p>\"'${button('\"'back','← Back','back')}\"'`,true);}\n if(menu==='\"'about')html=panel('MISSION ARCHIVE','About / credits',aboutHtml(),true);\n if(menu==='dev'){const disabled=net?.active&&\"'!net.isHost;const sliders=[['\"'meteorSpeed','Meteor speed',.3,2.5,.1],['threatRate','Meteor frequency',.3,2.5,.1],['defenseDuration','Defense seconds',8,50,1],['rescueTime','Rescue seconds',25,150,5],['beamPower','Tractor strength',.3,3,.1],['pilotSpeed','Shuttle speed',.5,2,.1]];html=panel('DEVELOPER TOOLS','Mission control.',\"'`<p class=\"tip\">Live balance controls. Duration changes apply to the next phase. ${disabled?'\"'Only the session host can change the simulation.':''}</p>\"'${sliders.map(([key,label,min,max,step])=>`<div class=\"setting\"><label for=\"dev-${key}\">${label} <output id=\"out-${key}\">${game.config[key]}</output></label><input ${disabled?'\"'disabled':''} id=\\\"dev-\"'${key}\" data-dev=\"${key}\" type=\"range\" min=\"${min}\" max=\"${max}\" step=\"${step}\" value=\"${game.config[key]}\"></div>`).join('\"'')}<div class=\\\"setting\\\"><span>Invincible ark</span>\"'${button('\"'god',game.config.invincible?'On':'Off')}</div><div class=\\\"menuButtons\\\">\"'${button('\"'next','Skip to next phase')}\"'${button('\"'heal','Repair ark & refill energy')}\"'${button('\"'resetdev','Reset balance defaults')}\"'${button('\"'back','← Back')}</div><p class=\\\"tip\\\" id=\\\"devDiag\\\">Three.js r180 · Rapier \"'${esc(window.__game?.physicsVersion||'\"'0.19.3')} · \"'${scene?.ready?.webgpu?'\"'WebGPU':'WebGPU renderer / compatibility backend'}<br>Simulation \"'${Math.round(game.state.time)}s · ${game.state.meteors.length} meteors · ${game.state.totalRescued} rescued</p>`,true);}\n if(menu==='\"'end'){const won=game.state.phase==='victory';html=panel(won?'MISSION COMPLETE':'MISSION LOST',won?'Everybody’s somebody.':'The stars are unforgiving.',\"'`<p>${won?'\"'Twelve small lives. One improbable escape. Somewhere in the dark, the ark’s new passengers begin to sing.':'Your brave little ark held out as long as it could. There are still strange little lives out there worth another try.'}</p><p class=\\\"endScore\\\">\"'${game.state.score.toLocaleString()}</p><div class=\"endFacts\"><span>${game.state.totalRescued} / 12 saved</span><span>${game.state.kills} meteors stopped</span></div><div class=\"menuButtons\">${button('\"'retry','Fly again','primary')}\"'${button('\"'title','Return to title')}\"'${button('\"'about','About / credits')}</div>\"'`);}\n $('\"'menu').innerHTML=html;}\nfunction action(name){if(loading||hubEnded)return;if(activeInput(inputMode))return;audio.event('menu');if(name==='start')launch(1);else if(name==='coop')launch(2);else if(name==='pause')pause();else if(name==='resume')closeMenu();else if(name==='title')toTitle();else if(name==='retry')launch(localCount);else if(['settings','how','about','dev'].includes(name)){returnMenu=menu||'title';setMenu(name);}else if(name==='back'){if(returnMenu==='title')closeMenu();else setMenu(returnMenu||'pause');}else if(name==='glyphs'){glyphs=glyphs==='ps'?'xbox':'ps';settings.glyphs=glyphs;saveSettings();renderMenu();focusFirst();}else if(name==='motion'){reducedMotion=\"'!reducedMotion;settings.reducedMotion=reducedMotion;saveSettings();renderMenu();focusFirst();}else if(!net?.active||net.isHost){if(name==='\"'god'){game.config.invincible=\"'!game.config.invincible;renderMenu();focusFirst();}if(name==='\"'next'){game.advance();closeMenu();}if(name==='heal'){game.state.hull=6;game.state.charge=100;audio.event('rescue');}if(name==='resetdev'){Object.assign(game.config,DEFAULTS);renderMenu();focusFirst();}}}\ndocument.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button[data-action]');if(b)action(b.dataset.action);});\ndocument.addEventListener('pointerover',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button');if(b&&e.pointerType\"'!=='\"'touch')b.focus({preventScroll:true});});\ndocument.addEventListener('input',e=>{const el=e.target;if(el.dataset.setting){const k=el.dataset.setting;settings[k]=Number(el.value);audio[k==='music'?'setMusic':'setSfx'](settings[k]);\"'$(k+'\"'Out').textContent=Math.round(settings[k]*100)+'%';saveSettings();}if(el.dataset.dev&&(\"'!net?.active||net.isHost)){game.config[el.dataset.dev]=Number(el.value);$('\"'out-'+el.dataset.dev).textContent=el.value;}});\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(['Space','ArrowUp','ArrowDown','ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','Tab'].includes(e.code)&&e.target.tagName\"'!=='\"'INPUT')e.preventDefault();if(activeInput('keyboard'))return;keys.add(e.code);if(e.repeat)return;if(e.code==='Escape'||e.code==='KeyP'){if(menu&&menu\"'!=='\"'pause'){action('back');}else pause();return;}if(menu||game?.state.phase==='title'){if(['ArrowUp','ArrowDown','KeyW','KeyS','Tab'].includes(e.code)){navigate(['ArrowUp','KeyW'].includes(e.code)?-1:1);}else if(e.code==='Enter'||e.code==='Space'){if(e.target.tagName\"'!=='\"'BUTTON')document.activeElement?.click();}else if(['ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','KeyA','KeyD'].includes(e.code))adjustSlider(['ArrowLeft','KeyA'].includes(e.code)?-1:1);}});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup',e=>keys.delete(e.code));window.addEventListener('blur',()=>{keys.clear();mouse.down=false;touches.clear();stick=null;if(\"'!net?.active&&game&&['\"'defense','rescue','warp'].includes(game.state.phase)&&\"'!game.state.attract&&!menu)setMenu('\"'pause');});\nfunction navigate(dir){const root=menu?\"'$('\"'menu'):\"'$('\"'title');const items=[...root.querySelectorAll('button,input:not([disabled])')];if(\"'!items.length)return;let idx=items.indexOf(document.activeElement);idx=(idx+dir+items.length)%items.length;items[idx].focus({preventScroll:true});items[idx].scrollIntoView({block:'\"'nearest'});audio.event('menu');}\nfunction adjustSlider(dir){const el=document.activeElement;if(el?.type==='range'){el.value=clamp(Number(el.value)+Number(el.step||1)*dir,Number(el.min),Number(el.max));el.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));}}\nfunction worldPoint(e){const a=innerWidth/innerHeight,hh=Math.max(10.125,18/a);return{x:(e.clientX/innerWidth*2-1)*hh*a,y:(1-e.clientY/innerHeight*2)*hh};}\n\"'$('\"'game').addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(e.pointerType==='touch'){const t=touches.get(e.pointerId);if(t){t.x=e.clientX;t.y=e.clientY;if(t.side==='right'){const p=worldPoint(e);mouse.x=p.x;mouse.y=p.y;}}return;}mouse.moved=true;inputMode='keyboard';idle=0;const p=worldPoint(e);mouse.x=p.x;mouse.y=p.y;if(mouse.down)mouse.target=p;});\n\"'$('\"'game').addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(activeInput(e.pointerType==='touch'?'touch':'keyboard'))return;e.preventDefault();\"'$('\"'game').setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);if(e.pointerType==='touch'){touchEnabled=true;document.body.classList.add('touch');const t={x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY,ox:e.clientX,oy:e.clientY,side:e.clientX<innerWidth*.55?'left':'right'};touches.set(e.pointerId,t);if(t.side==='left'){stick=t;\"'$('\"'touchRing').style.cssText=\"'`display:block;left:${t.x-50}px;top:${t.y-50}px`;}else{if(performance.now()-lastTouch<330)touchPulse=true;lastTouch=performance.now();const p=worldPoint(e);mouse.x=p.x;mouse.y=p.y;}}else{mouse.down=true;mouse.target=worldPoint(e);}});\nfunction releasePointer(e){if(e.pointerType==='\"'touch'){const t=touches.get(e.pointerId);if(t===stick){stick=null;\"'$('\"'touchRing').style.display='none';}touches.delete(e.pointerId);}else{mouse.down=false;mouse.target=null;}}\nwindow.addEventListener('pointerup',releasePointer);window.addEventListener('pointercancel',releasePointer);window.addEventListener('contextmenu',e=>e.preventDefault());\nfunction padInput(p){const dead=v=>Math.abs(v||0)<.17?0:v;return{x:dead(p.axes[0]),y:-dead(p.axes[1]),aimX:dead(p.axes[2])||dead(p.axes[0]),aimY:-dead(p.axes[3])||-dead(p.axes[1]),fire:\"'!!(p.buttons[7]?.pressed||p.buttons[5]?.pressed),pulse:!!p.buttons[0]?.pressed};}\nfunction pollPads(){const pads=[...navigator.getGamepads()].filter(Boolean);for(let i=0;i<pads.length;i++){const p=pads[i],prev=lastPadButtons[i]||[];const pressed=j=>p.buttons[j]?.pressed&&!prev[j];const any=p.buttons.some(b=>b.pressed)||p.axes.some(a=>Math.abs(a)>.3);if(any){if(activeInput('\"'gamepad')){lastPadButtons[i]=p.buttons.map(b=>b.pressed);continue;}}if(pressed(9)&&\"'!p.buttons[8]?.pressed)pause();if(menu||game?.state.phase==='\"'title'){const now=performance.now();const dy=(p.buttons[13]?.pressed?1:0)-(p.buttons[12]?.pressed?1:0)+(Math.abs(p.axes[1])>.5?Math.sign(p.axes[1]):0);const dx=(p.buttons[15]?.pressed?1:0)-(p.buttons[14]?.pressed?1:0)+(Math.abs(p.axes[0])>.5?Math.sign(p.axes[0]):0);if(now-lastNav>185&&(dy||dx)){if(dy)navigate(Math.sign(dy));else adjustSlider(Math.sign(dx));lastNav=now;}if(pressed(0))document.activeElement?.click();if(pressed(1)&&menu)action('back');}lastPadButtons[i]=p.buttons.map(b=>b.pressed);}return pads;}\nfunction localInputs(pads){const p0=game.state.players.find(p=>p.id===(net?.active?net.me:0));let x=(keys.has('KeyD')?1:0)-(keys.has('KeyA')?1:0),y=(keys.has('KeyW')?1:0)-(keys.has('KeyS')?1:0);let aimX=x,aimY=y;let fire=keys.has('Space')||mouse.down,pulse=keys.has('ShiftLeft');if(mouse.moved&&mouse.down&&game.state.phase==='defense'){aimX=mouse.x;aimY=mouse.y;}if(mouse.down&&mouse.target&&game.state.phase==='rescue'&&\"'!x&&!y&&p0){x=clamp((mouse.target.x-p0.x)*2,-1,1);y=clamp((mouse.target.y-p0.y)*2,-1,1);}if(touchEnabled&&touches.size){if(stick){x=clamp((stick.x-stick.ox)/55,-1,1);y=clamp((stick.oy-stick.y)/55,-1,1);aimX=x;aimY=y;}fire=true;if(game.state.phase==='\"'defense'){if(touches.size>1){aimX=mouse.x;aimY=mouse.y;}else if(\"'!x&&!y){const m=[...game.state.meteors].sort((a,b)=>Math.hypot(a.x,a.y)-Math.hypot(b.x,b.y))[0];if(m){aimX=m.x;aimY=m.y;}}}pulse=touchPulse;touchPulse=false;}\n let one={x,y,aimX,aimY,fire,pulse};if(pads[0]&&inputMode==='\"'gamepad')one=padInput(pads[0]);let two={x:(keys.has('ArrowRight')?1:0)-(keys.has('ArrowLeft')?1:0),y:(keys.has('ArrowUp')?1:0)-(keys.has('ArrowDown')?1:0),fire:keys.has('Enter'),pulse:keys.has('ControlRight')};if(pads[1])two=padInput(pads[1]);return [one,two];}\nfunction updateHud(){const s=game.state;const playing=s.phase\"'!=='\"'title';show('title',\"'!playing);show('\"'hud',playing&&\"'!['\"'victory','gameover'].includes(s.phase));show('attract',s.attract);show('touchHint',touchEnabled&&playing&&\"'!menu&&!s.attract);show('\"'announce',s.announcementTime>0&&playing&&s.phase\"'!=='\"'warp');\"'$('\"'announce').textContent=s.announcement;show('warp',s.phase==='warp');if(s.phase==='warp'){\"'$('\"'warpTitle').textContent=s.nextPhase==='rescue'?'A small world. A big rescue.':s.nextPhase==='finale'?'The last light.':worlds[s.world];\"'$('\"'warpText').textContent=s.nextPhase==='rescue'?'Two pairs are waiting below. Bring them home.':s.nextPhase==='finale'?'All twelve aboard. Hold the line for thirty seconds.':'Engines warm. Passengers mildly confused.';}\n \"'$('\"'worldLabel').textContent=s.finalDefense?'04 / THE LAST LIGHT':\"'`0${s.world+1} / ${worlds[s.world]}`;$('\"'phaseTitle').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?'Bring them home.':s.finalDefense?'One last storm.':'Protect the ark.';\"'$('\"'missionLine').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?\"'`${s.rescued} / ${s.goal} creatures delivered · two per shuttle`:'\"'Four directions. One very precious ship.';\"'$('\"'hullValue').textContent='▰'.repeat(s.hull)+'▱'.repeat(6-s.hull);\"'$('\"'timerLabel').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?'Solar flare':'Next jump';\"'$('\"'timerValue').textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(s.remaining))+'s';\"'$('\"'timerValue').style.color=s.remaining<12?'var(--orange)':'var(--paper)';\"'$('\"'scoreValue').textContent=s.score.toLocaleString();\"'$('\"'chargeLabel').textContent=(s.phase==='rescue'?'Boost':'Shield pulse')+' · '+Math.round(s.charge)+'%';\"'$('\"'chargeFill').style.width=s.charge+'%';\"'$('\"'cargoValue').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?s.players.map(p=>\"'`P${p.id+1}: ${'\"'●'.repeat(p.cargo.length)}\"'${'\"'○'.repeat(2-p.cargo.length)} aboard\"'`).join('\"'  /  '):\"'`${s.totalRescued} / 12 passengers safe`;\n const ctrl=inputMode==='\"'gamepad',trigger=ctrl?(glyphs==='ps'?'R2':'RT'):'SPACE',ability=ctrl?(glyphs==='ps'?'✕':'A'):'SHIFT';\"'$('\"'helpTitle').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?\"'`${trigger} · Tractor beam`:`${trigger} · Hold to fire`;$('\"'helpText').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?'Fly low. Hold steady over a creature. Carry two, then return to the glowing dock.':'Aim up, down, left or right. Break meteors before they hit the ark. Energy refills itself.';\"'$('\"'controlsLine').innerHTML=\"'`<span class=\"key\">${ctrl?'\"'L': 'WASD'}</span> \"'${s.phase==='\"'rescue'?'Fly':'Aim'} &nbsp; <span class=\\\"key\\\">\"'${ability}</span> ${s.phase==='\"'rescue'?'Boost':'Pulse'} &nbsp; <span class=\\\"key\\\">\"'${ctrl?'\"'OPTIONS':'ESC'}</span> Pause\"'`;\n if(['\"'victory','gameover'].includes(s.phase)&&\"'!endShown){endShown=true;if(s.attract){setTimeout(()=>{if(game.state.attract)startAttract();},4500);}else if(!net.active)setMenu('\"'end');}}\nfunction startAttract(){if(net?.active)return;closeMenu();game.start(1,null,true);game.config.defenseDuration=12;show('title',false);show('hud',true);show('attract',true);endShown=false;}\nfunction frame(now){const dt=Math.min(.05,(now-lastTime)/1000);lastTime=now;const pads=pollPads();net?.tick(dt);const s=game.state;if(\"'!menu&&s.phase==='\"'title'&&\"'!net?.active){idle+=dt;if(idle>=10)startAttract();}\n const canRun=!hubEnded&&(!net?.active||hubStarted)&&(!menu||net?.active||s.attract);if(canRun){const [one,two]=localInputs(pads);if(net.active){if(net.isHost){if(!net.info.server)remoteInputs[net.me]=one;game.update(dt,remoteInputs);net.broadcast(game.snapshot());}else net.sendInput(one);}else game.update(dt,{0:one,1:two});}\n if(s.phase==='\"'title')s.time+=dt;scene.render(game.state,reducedMotion?Math.min(dt,.008):dt);audio.update(game.state,canRun?dt:0);if((frameCount++%3)===0)updateHud();requestAnimationFrame(frame);}\nasync function boot(){try{const physicsVersion=await initPhysics();game=new Game(audio);scene=await createScene(\"'$('\"'game'));net=await createNetwork({onStart(info){hubStarted=true;game.start(info.players.length,info.players.map(p=>p.id));endShown=false;closeMenu();show('title',false);show('hud',true);},onState(state){game.state=state;},onInput(id,input){remoteInputs[id]=input;},onEnd(){hubEnded=true;closeMenu();audio.setMuted(true);game.state.ended=true;},onTimeUp(){if(net.isHost)net.finish(game.state.score,game.state.phase==='victory');},onLeave({id}){delete remoteInputs[id];const p=game.state.players.find(p=>p.id===id);if(p)p.active=false;}});game.onFinish=(score,won)=>{if(net.active)net.finish(score,won);};loading=false;show('loading',false);if(net.active){show('title',false);show('hud',false);\"'$('\"'announce').textContent='CREW LINKED · WAITING FOR LAUNCH';show('announce',true);net.ready();}else{toTitle();if(navigator.maxTouchPoints>0){touchEnabled=true;document.body.classList.add('touch');}}\n window.__game={game,scene,audio,net,physicsVersion,renderAudioTest,getState:()=>game.snapshot(),getUI:()=>({menu,inputMode,idle,localCount,hubStarted,hubEnded,touchEnabled}),setPhase(name){if(net.active&&\"'!net.isHost)return;if(name==='\"'rescue')game.beginRescue();else if(name==='finale'){game.state.finalDefense=true;game.state.phase='defense';game.state.remaining=30;}else if(name==='victory')game.end(true);},start:launch,pause,action};window.__gameReady=true;lastTime=performance.now();requestAnimationFrame(frame);}\n catch(error){loading=false;console.error(error);\"'$('\"'loading').innerHTML=\"'`<span class=\"label\">FLIGHT DELAYED</span><h2>We need a working WebGPU renderer.</h2><p class=\"error\">${esc(error.message)}</p><p>Use a current browser with hardware acceleration enabled.</p>`;window.__gameError=error.message;if(globalThis.AIHub?.active)AIHub.fail(error.message);}}\nwindow.addEventListener('\"'resize',()=>scene?.resize());boot();\nEOF\ncat > credits.json <<'EOF'\n{\n \\\"sourceInformation\\\":{\\\"date\\\":\\\"2026-11-05 21:25:58\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"Cosmic Ark (1982)\\\",\\\"plan\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"Arcade shooter / rescue action\\\",\\\"perspective\\\":\\\"Fixed front orthographic 2.5D\\\",\\\"tech\\\":\\\"Three.js r180 WebGPURenderer + TSL; Rapier 0.19.3; Web Audio; Gamepad API; AI Hub Session Protocol v1 client 1.4.0\\\",\\\"artDirection\\\":\\\"Procedural cel shading, dark ink silhouettes, pastel alien dioramas\\\",\\\"animation\\\":\\\"Three.js AnimationMixer and keyframe tracks, plus procedural motion\\\",\\\"audio\\\":\\\"Code-generated music at 10% default, synthesized effects and Animalese-style gibberish voices; no audio files\\\",\\\"online\\\":\\\"AI Hub 1–4 player shared-world co-op; standalone 1–2 local co-op\\\",\\\"testing\\\":\\\"Headless scripted simulation, full campaign playthrough, browser input/audio checks and AI Hub harness; screenshots for visual review\\\",\\\"research\\\":\\\"No source research; native model knowledge. Required AI Hub protocol and client read directly.\\\",\\\"environment\\\":\\\"Codex CLI (headless); Linux\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"OpenAI, gpt-6.1-sol, reasoning effort ultra\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"added on import\\\"},\n \\\"testingFeedback\\\":[\\\"Testing caught 2 issues: a Rapier descriptor method mismatch and invisible star points. Final integration testing in progress.\\\",\\\"1 critical issue: the Rapier descriptor mismatch prevented meteor spawning; fixed.\\\",\\\"Complete automated solo and four-pilot campaigns verified all twelve rescues and the final victory.\\\",\\\"Headless WebGPU screenshots were blank; renderer state checks and a headed compatibility screenshot were more useful.\\\"],\n \\\"engineFeedback\\\":[\\\"Three.js TSL makes stepped cel lighting and reusable procedural materials straightforward.\\\",\\\"Used a rigid-body instance method on a Rapier descriptor; installed type definitions gave the correct method.\\\",\\\"The alternating defense/rescue simulation, controller navigation and host-authoritative co-op state.\\\",\\\"Validating WebGPU visuals in headless Chromium, where screenshots can be blank despite successful rendering.\\\",\\\"none\\\",\\\"More reliable headless WebGPU screenshots and clearer diagnostics for renderer backend selection.\\\"],\n \\\"promptFeedback\\\":[\\\"The source-inspired mechanics, single-file deliverable and explicit controller-first requirements provide a clear target.\\\",\\\"The research ban alongside mandatory online integration was interpreted as no source research, with direct access to required protocol files.\\\",\\\"Completing the campaign, input modes, procedural art and real multiplayer in one portable HTML file.\\\",\\\"State explicitly that reading required integration files is allowed without source research.\\\"]\n}\nEOF\ncat > build.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport {readFileSync,writeFileSync} from 'node:fs';\nimport {spawnSync} from 'node:child_process';\nconst {slug}=JSON.parse(readFileSync('project.json','utf8'));\nconst out=spawnSync('bun',['build','app.js','--target','browser','--minify','--outfile','game.bundle.js'],{encoding:'utf8'});\nif(out.status\"'!==0){console.error(out.stderr);process.exit(1);}\nlet html=readFileSync('\"'index.template.html','utf8');\nconst client=readFileSync('hub-session.js','utf8');\nhtml=html.replace('<\"'!--HUB_CLIENT-->'\"','<script>'+client.replace(/<\\\\/script/gi,'<\\\\\\\\/script')+'</script>');\nhtml=html.replace('/*GAME_BUNDLE*/',readFileSync('game.bundle.js','utf8').replace(/<\\\\/script/gi,'<\\\\\\\\/script'));\nwriteFileSync('../'+slug+'.html',html);\nwriteFileSync('game.html',html);\nconsole.log('Built '+slug+'.html');\nEOF\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > app.js <<'EOF'\nimport {createScene} from './scene.js';\nimport {createAudio,renderAudioTest} from './audio.js';\nimport {Game,DEFAULTS,initPhysics} from './game.js';\nimport {createNetwork} from './network.js';\nimport interview from './credits.json';\nconst \"'$=id=>document.getElementById(id), clamp=(v,a,b)=>Math.max(a,Math.min(b,v));\nconst worlds=['\"'THE MOSS MOON','THE AMBER WILDS','THE VIOLET TIDE'];\nconst audio=createAudio();let game,scene,net,menu='',returnMenu='',lastTime=performance.now(),idle=0,inputMode='keyboard',glyphs='ps',localCount=1,hubStarted=false,hubEnded=false,reducedMotion=false,endShown=false,frameCount=0,loading=true,lastPadButtons=[],lastNav=0;\nconst keys=new Set(),remoteInputs={},mouse={x:0,y:1,down:false,moved:false,target:null},touches=new Map();let touchEnabled=false,touchPulse=false,lastTouch=0,stick=null;\nconst settings={music:.1,sfx:.65,glyphs:'ps',reducedMotion:false};\ntry{Object.assign(settings,JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('great-space-escape.settings')||'{}'));}catch{}\naudio.setMusic(settings.music);audio.setSfx(settings.sfx);glyphs=settings.glyphs;reducedMotion=settings.reducedMotion;\nfunction saveSettings(){try{localStorage.setItem('great-space-escape.settings',JSON.stringify(settings));}catch{}}\nfunction esc(s){return String(s).replace(/[&<>\\\"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\\\"':'&quot;',\\\"'\\\":'&#39;'}[c]));}\nfunction show(id,value){\"'$(id).hidden=!value;}\nfunction focusFirst(){requestAnimationFrame(()=>{const area=!$('\"'menu').hidden?\"'$('\"'menu'):\"'$('\"'title');area.querySelector('button')?.focus({preventScroll:true});});}\nfunction activeInput(mode='keyboard'){inputMode=mode;idle=0;audio.unlock();if(game?.state.attract){toTitle();return true;}return hubEnded;}\nfunction setMenu(name,back=''){if(loading||hubEnded)return;menu=name;if(back)returnMenu=back;renderMenu();audio.event('menu');focusFirst();}\nfunction closeMenu(){menu='';\"'$('\"'menu').hidden=true;idle=0;}\nfunction toTitle(){if(net?.active)return;closeMenu();game.reset('title',1);game.state.attract=false;endShown=false;idle=0;audio.setMuted(false);show('title',true);show('hud',false);show('attract',false);focusFirst();}\nfunction launch(count=1){if(net?.active)return;localCount=count;game.start(count);endShown=false;closeMenu();show('title',false);show('hud',true);audio.unlock();}\nfunction pause(){if(\"'!game||loading||hubEnded||game.state.phase==='\"'title')return;if(menu==='pause')closeMenu();else if(menu)closeMenu();else setMenu('pause');}\nfunction button(action,label,cls=''){return \"'`<button class=\"${cls}\" data-action=\"${action}\">${label}</button>`;}\nfunction panel(label,title,content,wide=false){return `<div class=\"panel ${wide?'\"'wide':''}\\\"><span class=\\\"label\\\">\"'${label}</span><h2>${title}</h2>${content}</div>`;}\nfunction aboutHtml(){const labels={date:'\"'Date',source:'Source',plan:'Plan',genre:'Genre',perspective:'Perspective',tech:'Tech',artDirection:'Art direction',animation:'Animation',audio:'Audio',online:'Online',testing:'Testing',research:'Research',environment:'Environment',model:'Model',usage:'Usage'};let html='<p>A small act of cosmic kindness. Built as an original tribute to the rescue-and-defend rhythm of Cosmic Ark.</p><div class=\\\"aboutgrid\\\">';for(const [key,label]of Object.entries(labels))html+=\"'`<div class=\"aboutitem\"><b>${label}</b><p>${esc(interview.sourceInformation[key])}</p></div>`;html+='\"'</div>';const groups=[['Testing Feedback',interview.testingFeedback],['Engine Feedback',interview.engineFeedback],['Prompt Feedback',interview.promptFeedback]];for(const [title,items]of groups){html+=\"'`<div class=\"feedback\"><h3>${title}</h3>`+items.map((text,i)=>`<p><b>${i+1}.</b> ${esc(text)}</p>`).join('\"'')+'</div>';}return html+button('back','← Back','back');}\nfunction renderMenu(){show('menu',\"'!!menu);if(!menu)return;let html='\"'';if(menu==='pause'){html=panel('FLIGHT ON HOLD',net?.active?'Crew console':'Take a breath.',\"'`<p>${net?.active?'\"'The shared mission continues while this console is open.':'Your passengers appreciate a pilot who takes breaks.'}</p><div class=\\\"menuButtons\\\">\"'${button('\"'resume','Resume flight','primary')}\"'${button('\"'how','Flight manual')}\"'${button('\"'settings','Settings')}\"'${button('\"'dev','Developer tools')}\"'${button('\"'about','About / credits')}\"'${!net?.active?button('\"'title','Return to title'):''}</div>\"'`);}\n if(menu==='\"'settings'){html=panel('PILOT PREFERENCES','Make yourself at home.',\"'`<div class=\"setting\"><label for=\"music\">Music <output id=\"musicOut\">${Math.round(settings.music*100)}%</output></label><input id=\"music\" data-setting=\"music\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\".01\" value=\"${settings.music}\" aria-label=\"Music volume\"></div><div class=\"setting\"><label for=\"sfx\">Effects & voices <output id=\"sfxOut\">${Math.round(settings.sfx*100)}%</output></label><input id=\"sfx\" data-setting=\"sfx\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\".01\" value=\"${settings.sfx}\" aria-label=\"Effects volume\"></div><div class=\"setting\"><span>Controller glyphs</span>${button('\"'glyphs',glyphs==='ps'?'PlayStation':'Xbox')}</div><div class=\\\"setting\\\"><span>Gentle motion</span>\"'${button('\"'motion',reducedMotion?'On':'Off')}</div><p class=\\\"tip\\\">Music starts at 10%. Settings stay on this device.</p>\"'${button('\"'back','← Back','back')}\"'`);}\n if(menu==='\"'how'){html=panel('THE FLIGHT MANUAL','Leave no weirdling behind.',\"'`<div class=\"howgrid\"><div><h3>01 / Stand your ground</h3><p>Aim in four directions. Hold fire to break incoming meteors before they reach the ark. A shield pulse clears nearby danger and costs 38% energy.</p><h3>02 / Get down there</h3><p>Fly below the dotted beam-range line. Hold the tractor beam over a creature until it pops aboard. You can carry two at once.</p></div><div><h3>03 / Bring them home</h3><p>Fly to the glowing dock beneath the ark to unload automatically. Save both pairs before the next solar flare. Dodge the pink sentries or boost through them.</p><h3>04 / One last storm</h3><p>Three worlds. Twelve passengers. Survive the final 30-second barrage to escape. The crew shares six hull points; each world repairs one.</p></div></div><p><b>Pad:</b> Left stick: aim / fly · R2: fire / beam · ${glyphs==='\"'ps'?'Cross':'A'}: pulse / boost · Options: pause.<br><b>Keyboard:</b> WASD: aim / fly · Mouse: aim · Space / left click: fire / beam · Shift: pulse / boost · Esc: pause.<br><b>Second local pilot:</b> second pad, or arrow keys + Enter + Right Ctrl.<br><b>Touch:</b> invisible left stick, automatic fire / beam, double-tap right to boost. Drag on the right to aim.</p><p class=\\\"tip\\\">Co-op: each pilot has a shuttle and a two-creature hold. Energy and hull are shared. In AI Hub, 1–4 pilots share one mission.</p>\"'${button('\"'back','← Back','back')}\"'`,true);}\n if(menu==='\"'about')html=panel('MISSION ARCHIVE','About / credits',aboutHtml(),true);\n if(menu==='dev'){const disabled=net?.active&&\"'!net.isHost;const sliders=[['\"'meteorSpeed','Meteor speed',.3,2.5,.1],['threatRate','Meteor frequency',.3,2.5,.1],['defenseDuration','Defense seconds',8,50,1],['rescueTime','Rescue seconds',25,150,5],['beamPower','Tractor strength',.3,3,.1],['pilotSpeed','Shuttle speed',.5,2,.1]];html=panel('DEVELOPER TOOLS','Mission control.',\"'`<p class=\"tip\">Live balance controls. Duration changes apply to the next phase. ${disabled?'\"'Only the session host can change the simulation.':''}</p>\"'${sliders.map(([key,label,min,max,step])=>`<div class=\"setting\"><label for=\"dev-${key}\">${label} <output id=\"out-${key}\">${game.config[key]}</output></label><input ${disabled?'\"'disabled':''} id=\\\"dev-\"'${key}\" data-dev=\"${key}\" type=\"range\" min=\"${min}\" max=\"${max}\" step=\"${step}\" value=\"${game.config[key]}\"></div>`).join('\"'')}<div class=\\\"setting\\\"><span>Invincible ark</span>\"'${button('\"'god',game.config.invincible?'On':'Off')}</div><div class=\\\"menuButtons\\\">\"'${button('\"'next','Skip to next phase')}\"'${button('\"'heal','Repair ark & refill energy')}\"'${button('\"'resetdev','Reset balance defaults')}\"'${button('\"'back','← Back')}</div><p class=\\\"tip\\\" id=\\\"devDiag\\\">Three.js r180 · Rapier \"'${esc(window.__game?.physicsVersion||'\"'0.19.3')} · \"'${scene?.ready?.webgpu?'\"'WebGPU':'WebGPU renderer / compatibility backend'}<br>Simulation \"'${Math.round(game.state.time)}s · ${game.state.meteors.length} meteors · ${game.state.totalRescued} rescued</p>`,true);}\n if(menu==='\"'end'){const won=game.state.phase==='victory';html=panel(won?'MISSION COMPLETE':'MISSION LOST',won?'Everybody’s somebody.':'The stars are unforgiving.',\"'`<p>${won?'\"'Twelve small lives. One improbable escape. Somewhere in the dark, the ark’s new passengers begin to sing.':'Your brave little ark held out as long as it could. There are still strange little lives out there worth another try.'}</p><p class=\\\"endScore\\\">\"'${game.state.score.toLocaleString()}</p><div class=\"endFacts\"><span>${game.state.totalRescued} / 12 saved</span><span>${game.state.kills} meteors stopped</span></div><div class=\"menuButtons\">${button('\"'retry','Fly again','primary')}\"'${button('\"'title','Return to title')}\"'${button('\"'about','About / credits')}</div>\"'`);}\n $('\"'menu').innerHTML=html;}\nfunction action(name){if(loading||hubEnded)return;if(activeInput(inputMode))return;audio.event('menu');if(name==='start')launch(1);else if(name==='coop')launch(2);else if(name==='pause')pause();else if(name==='resume')closeMenu();else if(name==='title')toTitle();else if(name==='retry')launch(localCount);else if(['settings','how','about','dev'].includes(name)){returnMenu=menu||'title';setMenu(name);}else if(name==='back'){if(returnMenu==='title')closeMenu();else setMenu(returnMenu||'pause');}else if(name==='glyphs'){glyphs=glyphs==='ps'?'xbox':'ps';settings.glyphs=glyphs;saveSettings();renderMenu();focusFirst();}else if(name==='motion'){reducedMotion=\"'!reducedMotion;settings.reducedMotion=reducedMotion;saveSettings();renderMenu();focusFirst();}else if(!net?.active||net.isHost){if(name==='\"'god'){game.config.invincible=\"'!game.config.invincible;renderMenu();focusFirst();}if(name==='\"'next'){game.advance();closeMenu();}if(name==='heal'){game.state.hull=6;game.state.charge=100;audio.event('rescue');}if(name==='resetdev'){Object.assign(game.config,DEFAULTS);renderMenu();focusFirst();}}}\ndocument.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button[data-action]');if(b)action(b.dataset.action);});\ndocument.addEventListener('pointerover',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button');if(b&&e.pointerType\"'!=='\"'touch')b.focus({preventScroll:true});});\ndocument.addEventListener('input',e=>{const el=e.target;if(el.dataset.setting){const k=el.dataset.setting;settings[k]=Number(el.value);audio[k==='music'?'setMusic':'setSfx'](settings[k]);\"'$(k+'\"'Out').textContent=Math.round(settings[k]*100)+'%';saveSettings();}if(el.dataset.dev&&(\"'!net?.active||net.isHost)){game.config[el.dataset.dev]=Number(el.value);$('\"'out-'+el.dataset.dev).textContent=el.value;}});\nwindow.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(['Space','ArrowUp','ArrowDown','ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','Tab'].includes(e.code)&&e.target.tagName\"'!=='\"'INPUT')e.preventDefault();if(activeInput('keyboard'))return;keys.add(e.code);if(e.repeat)return;if(e.code==='Escape'||e.code==='KeyP'){if(menu&&menu\"'!=='\"'pause'){action('back');}else pause();return;}if(menu||game?.state.phase==='title'){if(['ArrowUp','ArrowDown','KeyW','KeyS','Tab'].includes(e.code)){navigate(['ArrowUp','KeyW'].includes(e.code)?-1:1);}else if(e.code==='Enter'||e.code==='Space'){if(e.target.tagName\"'!=='\"'BUTTON')document.activeElement?.click();}else if(['ArrowLeft','ArrowRight','KeyA','KeyD'].includes(e.code))adjustSlider(['ArrowLeft','KeyA'].includes(e.code)?-1:1);}});\nwindow.addEventListener('keyup',e=>keys.delete(e.code));window.addEventListener('blur',()=>{keys.clear();mouse.down=false;touches.clear();stick=null;if(\"'!net?.active&&game&&['\"'defense','rescue','warp'].includes(game.state.phase)&&\"'!game.state.attract&&!menu)setMenu('\"'pause');});\nfunction navigate(dir){const root=menu?\"'$('\"'menu'):\"'$('\"'title');const items=[...root.querySelectorAll('button,input:not([disabled])')];if(\"'!items.length)return;let idx=items.indexOf(document.activeElement);idx=(idx+dir+items.length)%items.length;items[idx].focus({preventScroll:true});items[idx].scrollIntoView({block:'\"'nearest'});audio.event('menu');}\nfunction adjustSlider(dir){const el=document.activeElement;if(el?.type==='range'){el.value=clamp(Number(el.value)+Number(el.step||1)*dir,Number(el.min),Number(el.max));el.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));}}\nfunction worldPoint(e){const a=innerWidth/innerHeight,hh=Math.max(10.125,18/a);return{x:(e.clientX/innerWidth*2-1)*hh*a,y:(1-e.clientY/innerHeight*2)*hh};}\n\"'$('\"'game').addEventListener('pointermove',e=>{if(e.pointerType==='touch'){const t=touches.get(e.pointerId);if(t){t.x=e.clientX;t.y=e.clientY;if(t.side==='right'){const p=worldPoint(e);mouse.x=p.x;mouse.y=p.y;}}return;}mouse.moved=true;inputMode='keyboard';idle=0;const p=worldPoint(e);mouse.x=p.x;mouse.y=p.y;if(mouse.down)mouse.target=p;});\n\"'$('\"'game').addEventListener('pointerdown',e=>{if(activeInput(e.pointerType==='touch'?'touch':'keyboard'))return;e.preventDefault();\"'$('\"'game').setPointerCapture(e.pointerId);if(e.pointerType==='touch'){touchEnabled=true;document.body.classList.add('touch');const t={x:e.clientX,y:e.clientY,ox:e.clientX,oy:e.clientY,side:e.clientX<innerWidth*.55?'left':'right'};touches.set(e.pointerId,t);if(t.side==='left'){stick=t;\"'$('\"'touchRing').style.cssText=\"'`display:block;left:${t.x-50}px;top:${t.y-50}px`;}else{if(performance.now()-lastTouch<330)touchPulse=true;lastTouch=performance.now();const p=worldPoint(e);mouse.x=p.x;mouse.y=p.y;}}else{mouse.down=true;mouse.target=worldPoint(e);}});\nfunction releasePointer(e){if(e.pointerType==='\"'touch'){const t=touches.get(e.pointerId);if(t===stick){stick=null;\"'$('\"'touchRing').style.display='none';}touches.delete(e.pointerId);}else{mouse.down=false;mouse.target=null;}}\nwindow.addEventListener('pointerup',releasePointer);window.addEventListener('pointercancel',releasePointer);window.addEventListener('contextmenu',e=>e.preventDefault());\nfunction padInput(p){const dead=v=>Math.abs(v||0)<.17?0:v;return{x:dead(p.axes[0]),y:-dead(p.axes[1]),aimX:dead(p.axes[2])||dead(p.axes[0]),aimY:-dead(p.axes[3])||-dead(p.axes[1]),fire:\"'!!(p.buttons[7]?.pressed||p.buttons[5]?.pressed),pulse:!!p.buttons[0]?.pressed};}\nfunction pollPads(){const pads=[...navigator.getGamepads()].filter(Boolean);for(let i=0;i<pads.length;i++){const p=pads[i],prev=lastPadButtons[i]||[];const pressed=j=>p.buttons[j]?.pressed&&!prev[j];const any=p.buttons.some(b=>b.pressed)||p.axes.some(a=>Math.abs(a)>.3);if(any){if(activeInput('\"'gamepad')){lastPadButtons[i]=p.buttons.map(b=>b.pressed);continue;}}if(pressed(9)&&\"'!p.buttons[8]?.pressed)pause();if(menu||game?.state.phase==='\"'title'){const now=performance.now();const dy=(p.buttons[13]?.pressed?1:0)-(p.buttons[12]?.pressed?1:0)+(Math.abs(p.axes[1])>.5?Math.sign(p.axes[1]):0);const dx=(p.buttons[15]?.pressed?1:0)-(p.buttons[14]?.pressed?1:0)+(Math.abs(p.axes[0])>.5?Math.sign(p.axes[0]):0);if(now-lastNav>185&&(dy||dx)){if(dy)navigate(Math.sign(dy));else adjustSlider(Math.sign(dx));lastNav=now;}if(pressed(0))document.activeElement?.click();if(pressed(1)&&menu)action('back');}lastPadButtons[i]=p.buttons.map(b=>b.pressed);}return pads;}\nfunction localInputs(pads){const p0=game.state.players.find(p=>p.id===(net?.active?net.me:0));let x=(keys.has('KeyD')?1:0)-(keys.has('KeyA')?1:0),y=(keys.has('KeyW')?1:0)-(keys.has('KeyS')?1:0);let aimX=x,aimY=y;let fire=keys.has('Space')||mouse.down,pulse=keys.has('ShiftLeft');if(mouse.moved&&mouse.down&&game.state.phase==='defense'){aimX=mouse.x;aimY=mouse.y;}if(mouse.down&&mouse.target&&game.state.phase==='rescue'&&\"'!x&&!y&&p0){x=clamp((mouse.target.x-p0.x)*2,-1,1);y=clamp((mouse.target.y-p0.y)*2,-1,1);}if(touchEnabled&&touches.size){if(stick){x=clamp((stick.x-stick.ox)/55,-1,1);y=clamp((stick.oy-stick.y)/55,-1,1);aimX=x;aimY=y;}fire=true;if(game.state.phase==='\"'defense'){if(touches.size>1){aimX=mouse.x;aimY=mouse.y;}else if(\"'!x&&!y){const m=[...game.state.meteors].sort((a,b)=>Math.hypot(a.x,a.y)-Math.hypot(b.x,b.y))[0];if(m){aimX=m.x;aimY=m.y;}}}pulse=touchPulse;touchPulse=false;}\n let one={x,y,aimX,aimY,fire,pulse};if(pads[0]&&inputMode==='\"'gamepad')one=padInput(pads[0]);let two={x:(keys.has('ArrowRight')?1:0)-(keys.has('ArrowLeft')?1:0),y:(keys.has('ArrowUp')?1:0)-(keys.has('ArrowDown')?1:0),fire:keys.has('Enter'),pulse:keys.has('ControlRight')};if(pads[1])two=padInput(pads[1]);return [one,two];}\nfunction updateHud(){const s=game.state;const playing=s.phase\"'!=='\"'title';show('title',\"'!playing);show('\"'hud',playing&&\"'!['\"'victory','gameover'].includes(s.phase));show('attract',s.attract);show('touchHint',touchEnabled&&playing&&\"'!menu&&!s.attract);show('\"'announce',s.announcementTime>0&&playing&&s.phase\"'!=='\"'warp');\"'$('\"'announce').textContent=s.announcement;show('warp',s.phase==='warp');if(s.phase==='warp'){\"'$('\"'warpTitle').textContent=s.nextPhase==='rescue'?'A small world. A big rescue.':s.nextPhase==='finale'?'The last light.':worlds[s.world];\"'$('\"'warpText').textContent=s.nextPhase==='rescue'?'Two pairs are waiting below. Bring them home.':s.nextPhase==='finale'?'All twelve aboard. Hold the line for thirty seconds.':'Engines warm. Passengers mildly confused.';}\n \"'$('\"'worldLabel').textContent=s.finalDefense?'04 / THE LAST LIGHT':\"'`0${s.world+1} / ${worlds[s.world]}`;$('\"'phaseTitle').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?'Bring them home.':s.finalDefense?'One last storm.':'Protect the ark.';\"'$('\"'missionLine').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?\"'`${s.rescued} / ${s.goal} creatures delivered · two per shuttle`:'\"'Four directions. One very precious ship.';\"'$('\"'hullValue').textContent='▰'.repeat(s.hull)+'▱'.repeat(6-s.hull);\"'$('\"'timerLabel').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?'Solar flare':'Next jump';\"'$('\"'timerValue').textContent=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(s.remaining))+'s';\"'$('\"'timerValue').style.color=s.remaining<12?'var(--orange)':'var(--paper)';\"'$('\"'scoreValue').textContent=s.score.toLocaleString();\"'$('\"'chargeLabel').textContent=(s.phase==='rescue'?'Boost':'Shield pulse')+' · '+Math.round(s.charge)+'%';\"'$('\"'chargeFill').style.width=s.charge+'%';\"'$('\"'cargoValue').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?s.players.map(p=>\"'`P${p.id+1}: ${'\"'●'.repeat(p.cargo.length)}\"'${'\"'○'.repeat(2-p.cargo.length)} aboard\"'`).join('\"'  /  '):\"'`${s.totalRescued} / 12 passengers safe`;\n const ctrl=inputMode==='\"'gamepad',trigger=ctrl?(glyphs==='ps'?'R2':'RT'):'SPACE',ability=ctrl?(glyphs==='ps'?'✕':'A'):'SHIFT';\"'$('\"'helpTitle').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?\"'`${trigger} · Tractor beam`:`${trigger} · Hold to fire`;$('\"'helpText').textContent=s.phase==='rescue'?'Fly low. Hold steady over a creature. Carry two, then return to the glowing dock.':'Aim up, down, left or right. Break meteors before they hit the ark. Energy refills itself.';\"'$('\"'controlsLine').innerHTML=\"'`<span class=\"key\">${ctrl?'\"'L': 'WASD'}</span> \"'${s.phase==='\"'rescue'?'Fly':'Aim'} &nbsp; <span class=\\\"key\\\">\"'${ability}</span> ${s.phase==='\"'rescue'?'Boost':'Pulse'} &nbsp; <span class=\\\"key\\\">\"'${ctrl?'\"'OPTIONS':'ESC'}</span> Pause\"'`;\n if(['\"'victory','gameover'].includes(s.phase)&&\"'!endShown){endShown=true;if(s.attract){setTimeout(()=>{if(game.state.attract)startAttract();},4500);}else if(!net.active)setMenu('\"'end');}}\nfunction startAttract(){if(net?.active)return;closeMenu();game.start(1,null,true);game.config.defenseDuration=12;show('title',false);show('hud',true);show('attract',true);endShown=false;}\nfunction frame(now){const dt=Math.min(.05,(now-lastTime)/1000);lastTime=now;const pads=pollPads();net?.tick(dt);const s=game.state;if(\"'!menu&&s.phase==='\"'title'&&\"'!net?.active){idle+=dt;if(idle>=10)startAttract();}\n const canRun=!hubEnded&&(!net?.active||hubStarted)&&(!menu||net?.active||s.attract);if(canRun){const [one,two]=localInputs(pads);if(net.active){if(net.isHost){if(!net.info.server)remoteInputs[net.me]=one;game.update(dt,remoteInputs);net.broadcast(game.snapshot());}else net.sendInput(one);}else game.update(dt,{0:one,1:two});}\n if(s.phase==='\"'title')s.time+=dt;scene.render(game.state,reducedMotion?Math.min(dt,.008):dt);audio.update(game.state,canRun?dt:0);if((frameCount++%3)===0)updateHud();requestAnimationFrame(frame);}\nasync function boot(){try{const physicsVersion=await initPhysics();game=new Game(audio);scene=await createScene(\"'$('\"'game'));net=await createNetwork({onStart(info){hubStarted=true;game.start(info.players.length,info.players.map(p=>p.id));endShown=false;closeMenu();show('title',false);show('hud',true);},onState(state){game.state=state;},onInput(id,input){remoteInputs[id]=input;},onEnd(){hubEnded=true;closeMenu();audio.setMuted(true);game.state.ended=true;},onTimeUp(){if(net.isHost)net.finish(game.state.score,game.state.phase==='victory');},onLeave({id}){delete remoteInputs[id];const p=game.state.players.find(p=>p.id===id);if(p)p.active=false;}});game.onFinish=(score,won)=>{if(net.active)net.finish(score,won);};loading=false;show('loading',false);if(net.active){show('title',false);show('hud',false);\"'$('\"'announce').textContent='CREW LINKED · WAITING FOR LAUNCH';show('announce',true);net.ready();}else{toTitle();if(navigator.maxTouchPoints>0){touchEnabled=true;document.body.classList.add('touch');}}\n window.__game={game,scene,audio,net,physicsVersion,renderAudioTest,getState:()=>game.snapshot(),getUI:()=>({menu,inputMode,idle,localCount,hubStarted,hubEnded,touchEnabled}),setPhase(name){if(net.active&&\"'!net.isHost)return;if(name==='\"'rescue')game.beginRescue();else if(name==='finale'){game.state.finalDefense=true;game.state.phase='defense';game.state.remaining=30;}else if(name==='victory')game.end(true);},start:launch,pause,action};window.__gameReady=true;lastTime=performance.now();requestAnimationFrame(frame);}\n catch(error){loading=false;console.error(error);\"'$('\"'loading').innerHTML=\"'`<span class=\"label\">FLIGHT DELAYED</span><h2>We need a working WebGPU renderer.</h2><p class=\"error\">${esc(error.message)}</p><p>Use a current browser with hardware acceleration enabled.</p>`;window.__gameError=error.message;if(globalThis.AIHub?.active)AIHub.fail(error.message);}}\nwindow.addEventListener('\"'resize',()=>scene?.resize());boot();\nEOF\ncat > credits.json <<'EOF'\n{\n \\\"sourceInformation\\\":{\\\"date\\\":\\\"2026-11-05 21:25:58\\\",\\\"source\\\":\\\"Cosmic Ark (1982)\\\",\\\"plan\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"genre\\\":\\\"Arcade shooter / rescue action\\\",\\\"perspective\\\":\\\"Fixed front orthographic 2.5D\\\",\\\"tech\\\":\\\"Three.js r180 WebGPURenderer + TSL; Rapier 0.19.3; Web Audio; Gamepad API; AI Hub Session Protocol v1 client 1.4.0\\\",\\\"artDirection\\\":\\\"Procedural cel shading, dark ink silhouettes, pastel alien dioramas\\\",\\\"animation\\\":\\\"Three.js AnimationMixer and keyframe tracks, plus procedural motion\\\",\\\"audio\\\":\\\"Code-generated music at 10% default, synthesized effects and Animalese-style gibberish voices; no audio files\\\",\\\"online\\\":\\\"AI Hub 1–4 player shared-world co-op; standalone 1–2 local co-op\\\",\\\"testing\\\":\\\"Headless scripted simulation, full campaign playthrough, browser input/audio checks and AI Hub harness; screenshots for visual review\\\",\\\"research\\\":\\\"No source research; native model knowledge. Required AI Hub protocol and client read directly.\\\",\\\"environment\\\":\\\"Codex CLI (headless); Linux\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"OpenAI, gpt-6.1-sol, reasoning effort ultra\\\",\\\"usage\\\":\\\"added on import\\\"},\n \\\"testingFeedback\\\":[\\\"Testing caught 2 issues: a Rapier descriptor method mismatch and invisible star points. Final integration testing in progress.\\\",\\\"1 critical issue: the Rapier descriptor mismatch prevented meteor spawning; fixed.\\\",\\\"Complete automated solo and four-pilot campaigns verified all twelve rescues and the final victory.\\\",\\\"Headless WebGPU screenshots were blank; renderer state checks and a headed compatibility screenshot were more useful.\\\"],\n \\\"engineFeedback\\\":[\\\"Three.js TSL makes stepped cel lighting and reusable procedural materials straightforward.\\\",\\\"Used a rigid-body instance method on a Rapier descriptor; installed type definitions gave the correct method.\\\",\\\"The alternating defense/rescue simulation, controller navigation and host-authoritative co-op state.\\\",\\\"Validating WebGPU visuals in headless Chromium, where screenshots can be blank despite successful rendering.\\\",\\\"none\\\",\\\"More reliable headless WebGPU screenshots and clearer diagnostics for renderer backend selection.\\\"],\n \\\"promptFeedback\\\":[\\\"The source-inspired mechanics, single-file deliverable and explicit controller-first requirements provide a clear target.\\\",\\\"The research ban alongside mandatory online integration was interpreted as no source research, with direct access to required protocol files.\\\",\\\"Completing the campaign, input modes, procedural art and real multiplayer in one portable HTML file.\\\",\\\"State explicitly that reading required integration files is allowed without source research.\\\"]\n}\nEOF\ncat > build.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport {readFileSync,writeFileSync} from 'node:fs';\nimport {spawnSync} from 'node:child_process';\nconst {slug}=JSON.parse(readFileSync('project.json','utf8'));\nconst out=spawnSync('bun',['build','app.js','--target','browser','--minify','--outfile','game.bundle.js'],{encoding:'utf8'});\nif(out.status\"'!==0){console.error(out.stderr);process.exit(1);}\nlet html=readFileSync('\"'index.template.html','utf8');\nconst client=readFileSync('hub-session.js','utf8');\nhtml=html.replace('<\"'!--HUB_CLIENT-->'\"','<script>'+client.replace(/<\\\\/script/gi,'<\\\\\\\\/script')+'</script>');\nhtml=html.replace('/*GAME_BUNDLE*/',readFileSync('game.bundle.js','utf8').replace(/<\\\\/script/gi,'<\\\\\\\\/script'));\nwriteFileSync('../'+slug+'.html',html);\nwriteFileSync('game.html',html);\nconsole.log('Built '+slug+'.html');\nEOF\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"Built The-Great-Space-Escape-Cosmic-Ark-gpt-6.1-sol-ultra-20261105-212558.html\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
